  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Chinnadurai vs The State Of Tamil Nadu on 9 December, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P(MD)No.16949 of BEFORE THE MADURAI BENCH OF MADRAS HIGH COURT DATED: 09.12.2024 CORAM THE HONOURABLE MR.JUSTICE G.K.ILANTHIRAIYAN W.P(MD)No.16949 of 2019 Chinnadurai ... Petitioner Vs 1.The State of Tamil Nadu, Represented by its Principal Secretary, Health and Family Welfare Department, Fort St. George, Chennai. 2.The Commissioner of Food Safety, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, 359 Anna Salai, Chennai. 3.The Director of Public Health and Preventive Medicine, Government of Tamil Nadu, 359 Anna Salai, Chennai. 4.The District Collector, Collectorate, Korampallam, Thotthukudi District, Thoothukudi. 5.The Appointed Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department , Joint Director of Agriculture Buildings, 1st Floor, Collectorate Campus, Chinnadurai vs The State Of Tamil Nadu on 9 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/40575901/ 1 Korampallam, Thoothukudi. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/5 W.P(MD)No.1 6.The Revenue Divisional Officer, O/o Revene Divisional Officer, Tiruchendur, Thoothukudi District. 7.Udupi Krishna Jaggery Company, Vattanvillai, Vellalanvillai Post, Tiruchendur Taluk, Thoothukudi District. ... Respondents PRAYER: Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution of India, to issue a writ of Mandamus, directing the respondents 2 and 4 to consider the representation of the petitioner dated 17.04.2019 and further to take action against the seventh respondent in accordance with law. For Petitioner : Mr.V.Rajiv Rufus For RR 1 to 6 : Mr.M.Senthil Ayyanar Government Advocate For R 7 : Mr.M.Jegadeesh Pandian ORDER This Writ Petition has been filed for a direction, directing the respondents 2 and 4 to consider the representation of the petitioner dated 17.04.2019 and to take action as against the seventh respondent in accordance with law. 4.The District Collector, Collectorate, Korampallam, Thotthukudi District, Thoothukudi. 5.The Appointed Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Joint Director of Agriculture Buildings, 1st Floor, Collectorate Campus, Korampallam, Thoothukudi. 6.The Revenue Divisional Officer, O/o Revene Divisional Officer, Tiruchendur, Thoothukudi District. 7.Udupi Krishna Jaggery Company, Vattanvillai, Vellalanvillai Post, Tiruchendur Taluk, Thoothukudi District. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis G.K.ILANTHIRAIYAN, J. ps Order made in 09.12.2024 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Chinnadurai vs The State Of Tamil Nadu on 9 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/40575901/ 3",
